  "philosophy": "A mix is finished when the groove is undeniable: the beat carries an identity you can name in one bar, the low end moves as one articulated pocket, and the arrangement leaves space — the silence is as composed as the sound. Sections flip hard enough to feel, and the record breathes between the hits."
